                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a super fun game for two people willing to get a little close to each other. My fiance and I play together and she LOVES destroying me (just like in real life). While there is nothing new or original in this game, the colors are vibrant, the sounds are fun, and the game play is smooth even on older systems. I really enjoy the hectic and frenzied graphics which do add a level of distraction to what would otherwise be a simple space shooter.",
